      "id": "rationale--two-audio-paths-fail-for-unrelated-reasons",
      "label": "Do not merge the two audio paths in the RCA because the Rust rodio path fails on a missing file and the WebKit path fails on GStreamer, which is unrelated to any host GStreamer state",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "05 - Conversations/home-belajarcarabelajar-proyek-snipset/2026-09-27 - c12-deep-research-external-evidence [ses_f1acdd029ffeKApr0WsZBaKWdx].md",
