      "norm_label": "do not merge the two audio paths in the rca because the rust rodio path fails on a missing file and the webkit path fails on gstreamer, which is unrelated to any host gstreamer state"
    },
    {
      "id": "rationale--close-the-autoplay-theory",
      "label": "Close the autoplay theory rather than pursue it, because WebKitGTK defaults media-playback-requires-user-gesture to off and neither tauri-runtime-wry nor wry sets it",
